, hvigorw, hstack, and ohpm.</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row171501159662\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p1150959165\">sdk</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p141507591165\">HarmonyOS 26.0.0 Beta2 SDK</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p1150159861\">-</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row13150165913619\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p515015595610\">modelVersion</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p31500599613\">26.0.0</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p21507596617\">Version number in the development state.</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row91509591463\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p171501059261\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app#section45865492619\" target=\"_blank\">compatibleSdkVersion</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p1615011595619\">Earliest compatible version: 4.0.0(10)</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p415019591613\">Earliest version compatible with the application/atomic service.</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row215018591069\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p101505591061\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app#section45865492619\" target=\"_blank\">compileSdkVersion</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p1715011597615\">26.0.0</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p1715017595610\">SDK version for building the application/atomic service.</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row615016595619\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p121513592065\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app#section45865492619\" target=\"_blank\">targetSdkVersion</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p515115591869\">4.0.0(10)–26.0.0</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p41511559265\">Target SDK version of the application/atomic service, which is between <strong>compatibleSdkVersion</strong> and <strong>compileSdkVersion</strong>.</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section630821613712\"><a name=\"section630821613712\"></a><a name=\"section630821613712\"></a><h4>[h2]New and Enhanced Features</h4><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p16274915282\"><strong>Environment setup</strong></p> <ul id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__ul18271358142813\"><li id=\"li7824161192913\">Adds support for adding Agent and AgentUI to modules in projects of API version 26.0.0 or later. Agent provides agent extension capabilities, while AgentUI enables the display of the on-device Agent UI. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-add-new-ability\" target=\"_blank\">Adding an Ability</a>.</li></ul> <p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p4308131613716\"><strong>Writing and debugging apps</strong></p> <ul id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__ul6349125355512\"><li id=\"li45271610308\">Adds compatibility rules to CodeLinter. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-codelinter-rules-change\" target=\"_blank\">Rule Changes</a>.</li><li id=\"li1736022682412\">Adds support for debugging native child processes in DevEco Studio. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-debug-native-child-process\" target=\"_blank\">Debugging Native Child Processes</a>.</li><li id=\"li13349145355511\">Adds support for using wildcards in the <strong>include</strong> and <strong>exclude</strong> fields of the <strong>coverage-filter.json5</strong> file to filter files and folders. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-ui-test#section13756446154\" target=\"_blank\">Filtering Files for Coverage Test</a>.</li><li id=\"li648553613575\">Adds the following two fields to the <strong>coverage-filter.json5</strong> file. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-ui-test#section13756446154\" target=\"_blank\">Filtering Files for Coverage Test</a>.<ul id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__ul1655634910575\"><li id=\"li157681847115719\">Adds the <strong>includeHar</strong> field for specifying remote-source HAR packages to be included in coverage testing.</li><li id=\"li428610110589\">Adds the <strong>extraAbilities</strong> field for specifying Ability paths to generate black-box coverage data.</li></ul> </li></ul> <p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p63093161370\"><strong>Building apps</strong></p> <ul id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__ul126012044185620\"><li id=\"li19230133518388\">Adds the <strong>hvigor.daemon.idleTimeout</strong> field under <strong>properties</strong> in the <strong>hvigor-config.json5</strong> file for setting the maximum idle time of the daemon process. The idle time starts from the completion of the last build task. The <strong>daemon</strong> process exits when the maximum idle time is exceeded. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-set-options\" target=\"_blank\">hvigor-config.json5 File</a>.</li><li id=\"li106016444563\">Adds the <strong>disableStrictCheckPaths</strong> field under <strong>strictMode</strong> in the project-level <strong>build-profile.json5</strong> file for specifying the directory names of third-party libraries that do not require strict checks. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app\" target=\"_blank\">Project-level build-profile.json5 File</a>.</li><li id=\"li1313011218013\">Adds the <strong>getOhpmDependencyInfoV2</strong> and <strong>getOhpmRemoteHspDependencyInfoV2</strong> APIs to Hvigor to replace the existing <strong>getOhpmDependencyInfo</strong> and <strong>getOhpmRemoteHspDependencyInfo</strong> APIs, respectively For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-build-expanding-context\" target=\"_blank\">Plugin Context</a>.</li></ul> <p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p020844163011\"><strong>Optimizing app performance</strong></p> <ul id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__ul11962155418306\"><li id=\"li5962185419308\">Adds <strong>GlobalHandleObject</strong> as a common object under the (<strong>handle</strong>) tag. It records the <strong>napi_ref</strong> address and establishes the reference relationship between <strong>napi_ref</strong> and an ArkTS object. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-arkts-memory-leak-analysis#section135057191135\" target=\"_blank\">Case: Analyzing ArkTS Memory Leaks</a>.</li></ul> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section148621018122320\"><a name=\"section148621018122320\"></a><a name=\"section148621018122320\"></a><h4>DevEco Studio 26.0.0 Beta1 (26.0.0.461)</h4></div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1376764215234\"><a name=\"section1376764215234\"></a><a name=\"section1376764215234\"></a><h4>[h2]Compatibility</h4><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p17674422233\">The following table lists the tools provided by DevEco Studio 26.0.0.461, along with their corresponding development-state version and supported API versions.</p>  <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"table676734214233\"><caption><b>Table 5 </b>DevEco Studio</caption><thead><tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row197671042192313\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.9.3.2.4.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p47671042102314\">Item</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.9.3.2.4.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p207674421234\">Version</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.9.3.2.4.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p8767134252314\">Description</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row127675427234\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p376804212320\">HarmonyOS SDK</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p6768184216239\">HarmonyOS 26.0.0 Beta1 SDK</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p10768194210230\">-</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row77681642172320\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p176854216233\">HarmonyOS Emulator</p> </td> <td 