771154217235\">-</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row18771184272318\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p107711942172310\">modelVersion</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p1771742102315\">26.0.0</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p77714429233\">Version number in the development state.</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row14771194252315\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p4771174212239\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app#section45865492619\" target=\"_blank\">compatibleSdkVersion</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p87711742192314\">Earliest compatible version: 4.0.0(10)</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p127718429232\">Earliest version compatible with the application/atomic service.</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row11771842112312\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p07716427238\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app#section45865492619\" target=\"_blank\">compileSdkVersion</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p37711342122317\">26.0.0</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p77712042102314\">SDK version for building the application/atomic service.</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__row127711842142318\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.339999999999996%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p117716427239\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app#section45865492619\" target=\"_blank\">targetSdkVersion</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.300000000000004%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p117711042142311\">4.0.0(10)–26.0.0</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.36%\"><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p167719423233\">Target SDK version of the application/atomic service, which is between <strong>compatibleSdkVersion</strong> and <strong>compileSdkVersion</strong>.</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section179571925121314\"><a name=\"section179571925121314\"></a><a name=\"section179571925121314\"></a><h4>[h2]New and Enhanced Features</h4><p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p20899155717136\"><strong>Writing and debugging apps</strong></p> <ul id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__ul54252141379\"><li id=\"li13843733193111\">Adds support for developing projects of API version 26.0.0.</li><li id=\"li1083041419338\">Adds the load/unload modules to DevEco Studio, allowing you to load modules as needed to reduce memory usage and improve code indexing efficiency. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-load-unload-modules\" target=\"_blank\">Unloading and Loading a Module</a>.</li><li id=\"li13350426113612\">Adds support for viewing relationships between state variables in the editor. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-editer-overview#section2541105019101\" target=\"_blank\">View Binding Relationships of ArkUI Component State Variables</a>.</li><li id=\"li48144163811\">Adds correctness rules to CodeLinter. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-codelinter-rules-change\" target=\"_blank\">Rule Changes</a>.</li><li id=\"li0337133818442\">Adds support for performing static checks on C/C++ code using a custom Clang-Tidy. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-clang-tidy\" target=\"_blank\">Clang-Tidy Code Inspection</a>.</li><li id=\"li1223311221460\">Adds more open capabilities to debug signing for associated registered apps and support for requesting ACL permissions in DevEco Studio. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-signing\" target=\"_blank\">Configuring a Debug Signature</a>.</li><li id=\"li13464205091413\">Adds support for simultaneously previewing the UI of an app at eight typical breakpoints in DevEco Studio. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-previewer-arkui#section384317711155\" target=\"_blank\">Multi-Breakpoint Preview</a>.</li><li id=\"li99448444363\">Adds support for scenario-based simulation through emulator commands. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-emulator-command-line#section4653134015354\" target=\"_blank\">Scenario-based Simulation</a>.</li><li id=\"li18139164012447\">Adds startup acceleration for native debugging. After the first debugging session is complete, the debug server remains active, significantly reducing the time required to establish a debug connection for subsequent sessions. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-lldb-client-alive\" target=\"_blank\">Speeding Up Native Debugging Startup</a>.</li><li id=\"li1425414173720\">Adds support for mirroring a device screen to DevEco Studio. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-screen-mirroring\" target=\"_blank\">Mirroring Device Screens</a>.</li><li id=\"li484295811426\">Enhances database debugging with SQL syntax highlighting, auto-completion for keywords and table fields, and visual editing of table data. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-database-inspector\" target=\"_blank\">Database Debugging</a>.</li><li id=\"li654734311812\">Adds support in DevEco Studio for parsing minidump files generated by app crashes and displaying exception stacks, helping you quickly analyze and locate issues. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-analyze-dump\" target=\"_blank\">Parsing App Minidump Files</a>.</li><li id=\"li56714152118\">Adds support for filtering HiLog logs by log tag For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-setup-hilog#section87721353233\" target=\"_blank\">Filtering Logs by Log Tag</a>.</li><li id=\"li1268524412464\">Adds support for locating memory overflow, app freeze, and resource leak issues. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-operation-and-services\" target=\"_blank\">Using Operation Analyzer</a>.</li></ul> <p id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__p19553182491420\"><strong>Building apps</strong></p> <ul id=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000002588787318__ul1712433561816\"><li id=\"li512443521810\">Adds the <strong>apiCompatibilityCheck</strong> field under <strong>strictMode</strong> in the project-level <strong>build-profile.json5</strong> file for setting the ArkTS API compatibility check level. For details, see <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-build-profile-app\" target=\"_blank\">Project-level build-profile.json5 File</a>.</li><li id=\"li312453551813\">Adds the <strong>tsImportSoCheck</strong> field under <strong>tscConfig</strong> in the project-level <strong>build-profile.json5</strong> file for specifying whether to perform type resol